  triage:description "AI13 QA-1 BLOCKING-02 and BLOCKING-04 — the semantic-assertion test runner has no code path that ever emits the required producer-side JSON, so its assertions can never pass. Verified during AI.16 QA-1 classification pass: no missing merge-forward commit adds this producer-side emission anywhere in the repo. Pre-existing, independent gap." ;
